{# Age of AI — pre-interview brief, emailed to the guest T-1 day
   (rendered by pipelines/voices/generate_briefs.py). #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <h2 style="color:#7C3AED">Your Age of AI interview — tomorrow</h2>
  <p>Hi {{ guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Mira here — well, Mira's producers. Your interview is scheduled for
  <strong>{{ scheduled_at }}</strong>;
  <p><strong>How to join:</strong> open your personal studio link a few
  minutes before your slot, from a computer in a quiet room —
  <a href="https://nerranetwork.com/age-of-ai-studio.html?interview={{ interview_id }}">
  join your interview here</a>. Headphones or AirPods make you sound far
  better; a dedicated mic is better still. Camera is optional but
  appreciated (we record video for a future YouTube version). If the
  browser route fails for any reason, Mira can fall back to calling your
  phone — just reply to this email.</p>
  find a quiet spot and let it be a conversation, not a performance.</p>
  <h3>The angle we're excited about</h3>
  <p style="background:#faf5ff;border-left:4px solid #7C3AED;padding:.7em 1em">{{ thesis }}</p>
  <h3>Themes Mira plans to explore</h3>
  <ul>
  {% for q in questions %}
    <li>{{ q.question if q.question is defined else q }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p>No prep required — she follows the conversation, not the list. Near the
  end there's a quick lightning round and one closing question about a bet
  you're making that you can't prove yet. Worth a minute's thought.</p>
  <p>Reminders: the call is recorded for the podcast, and <strong>nothing
  publishes until you've reviewed and approved the transcript</strong>.</p>
  <p>— The Age of AI, Nerra Network</p>
</div>
